== Notes ==
* When not fought as a main boss, such as in a Boss Challenge room or a degraded boss, it will not be preceded by Fanatics and have no first phase.
** The Heretic also cannot perform its {{i|Brimstone}} attack outside of its regular boss room as there will be no unlit Fire Places.
* The Heretic can be instantly killed with {{I|Vade Retro}} if it is at 50% health or below.

== Trivia ==
* The Heretic originates from a [https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/2v2gl1/more_versus_screen_mockups/ Reddit post] by NotYourSaggitarius in 2015, as a versus screen mockup. The boss was later incorporated into the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* It appears to be a resurrected variation of {{e|The Haunt}} or {{e|The Forsaken}}.
* The only time the Heretic's empty right eye lights up is during its {{i|Brimstone}} attack.
* The Exorcists that appear during the beginning of the fight to summon the Heretic are found nowhere else in the {{s|Mausoleum}}, unlike in ''Antibirth'', where they were a regularly appearing Monster.
* If The Heretic is destroyed with a {{p|Chaos Card}} before the summoning animation finishes, any remaining Exorcists will become vulnerable and be stuck performing the ritual until they are killed.

